      <Docs>
        <summary>Callbacks are invoked immediately regardless of the frozen state of the target process. Not recommended. Only exists for backward-compatibility. This represents the behavior up to SDK 35. Starting with SDK 36, clients should set a policy to govern callback invocations when recipients are frozen.</summary>
